---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import credits from "../data/credits.json";
---
<Base title="Credits" description="Photo sources and licences for this concept site.">
  <section class="wrap c">
    <h1>Credits</h1>
    <p class="lede">Tidewell is a concept brand made as a portfolio piece. Every hotel, price and story is invented. The photographs are stock and do not show the hotels named.</p>
    <h2>Photography</h2>
    <p>The film on Casa Ombrella ("The way in") is <a href="https://www.pexels.com/video/15437344/">Atrani by drone</a> from Pexels, used under the <a href="https://www.pexels.com/license/">Pexels License</a>.</p>
    <p>All photographs come from <a href="https://unsplash.com">Unsplash</a> and are used under the <a href="https://unsplash.com/license">Unsplash License</a> (free for commercial use). Source page for each file:</p>
    <ol class="list">{credits.map((c: any) => <li><a href={c.source}>{c.source.replace("https://", "")}</a> <span class="muted">({c.file})</span></li>)}</ol>
    <h2>Type</h2>
    <p>Bodoni Moda (Indestructible Type) and Hanken Grotesk (Alfredo Marco Pradil), both under the SIL Open Font License, self-hosted via Fontsource.</p>
    <h2>Code</h2>
    <p>Built with Astro (MIT) and GSAP (Standard no-charge licence).</p>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .c { padding-top: 80px; padding-bottom: 120px; max-width: 900px; }
  .c h1 { font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px); } .c h2 { font-size: 34px; margin: 48px 0 12px; }
  .list { columns: 2; font-size: 14px; } .list a { word-break: break-all; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .list { columns: 1; } }
</style>
